"desc": "A small tabletop aquarium under a hood light, with a printed underwater backdrop, gravel, swaying plants, a bubbling volcano and air stone, a filter pouring a little waterfall, a sunken wreck, a treasure chest that opens to let out bubbles, a brass diver and a thermometer. Five little tropical fish swim their laps (a Siamese Tigerfish, a Blue Tang, an Angelfish, a Redhead Cichlid and a Severum) with a school of Fathead Minnows, while a snail creeps up the glass, a crab shuffles over the gravel and a starfish clings to the back. Purely decorative. Too big for a backpack, so it is carried in the hands.",
